        "reference": "FLAVOR_TEXT",
        "subject": "Flavor Text"
      },
      "translations": {
        "en_US": {
          "text": "\"Those little pests are tough. Even three miles up, they still manage to follow us.\" - Subhash",
          "locale": "en_US"
        },
        "de_DE": {
          "text": "„Diese kleinen Plagegeister sind hartnäckig. Selbst in fünf Kilometern Höhe folgen sie uns noch.“ – Subhash",
          "locale": "de_DE"
        },
        "it_IT": {
          "text": "\"Quei piccoli insetti sono tenaci. Persino a cinquemila metri di altitudine riescono a seguirci.\" - Subhash",
          "locale": "it_IT"
        },
        "es_ES": {
          "text": "«Esos bichillos son resistentes. Incluso a cinco kilómetros de distancia, se las apañan para seguirnos». — Subhash",
          "locale": "es_ES"
        },
        "fr_FR": {
          "text": "« Tenaces, les bestioles. Même à 4 km d'altitude, elles trouvent encore le moyen de nous suivre. » - Subhash",
          "locale": "fr_FR"
        }
      },
      "id": "01JNRGBWJ28Q6DMC54E7KBEXV7",
      "text": "\"Those little pests are tough. Even three miles up, they still manage to follow us.\" - Subhash"
    }
  ],
